config LEDS_DELUGE
	tristate "Synthstrom Deluge front-panel LEDs (via PIC)"
	depends on LEDS_CLASS
	depends on INPUT_DELUGE_PIC
	depends on ARCH_R7S72100 || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  36 indicator LEDs and two gold-knob 4-LED columns on the Synthstrom
	  Deluge front panel, exposed as LED-class devices. Output is sent over
	  the PIC32 (deluge-pic) on SCIF1.
